  "content": "<h5><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Yh9O6WH.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 全面重構的世界生成（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oh-the-biomes-youll-go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oh The Biomes You'll Go</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geophilic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geophilic</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ecologics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ecologics</a>）</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</h5><h5><strong>✔️ 超過100個任務</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 完全優化，支援光影模組</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 5個全新維度</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 全新Boss與生物（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/adventurez\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AdventureZ</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bosses-of-mass-destruction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bosses of Mass Destruction</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturalist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Naturalist</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 數百個全新地牢與建築（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/when-dungeons-arise-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">When Dungeons Arise</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explorify\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explorify</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/repurposed-structures-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures</a>）</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 可騎乘的<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fAdventureZ%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">龍</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 大量建築方塊</strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 生活品質功能，如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-waystones\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">傳送石碑</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xp-obelisk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗方尖碑</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/xaeros-minimap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Xaero的小地圖</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ 內建、<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tLTC6wYcWVM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">免費世界分享</a></strong></h5><h5><strong>✔️ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252f28903%252fbetter-mc-fabric-bmc1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">250+ 模組</a></strong>&nbsp;</h5><p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=393939&amp;labelColor=0843bf&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/12PUDvTmuUs?wmode=transparent\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/3ZdJX_Ig1vw\" width=\"410\" height=\"230\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></strong></span></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\">非官方 Minecraft 產品。未經 Mojang 或 Microsoft 核准或與其相關</span><br><img src=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HsbLq3-05PQ\" alt=\"\"></strong></strong></span></h5>",
